<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2013-11-19a.264.1" speakerid="uk.org.publicwhip/member/40310" speakername="Matthew Offord" colnum="264"  time="009:56:00" url="http://www.publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm201314/cmhansrd/cm131119/halltext/131119h0001.htm#131119h0001.htm_spnew20">
	<p pid="a.264.1/1">The hon. Gentleman illustrates that people do not have to have a teaching degree to make a valuable contribution to education. Indeed, the head teacher of the shadow education spokesman, the hon.</p>
	<p pid="a.264.1/2">Member for Cardiff West (Kevin Brennan), did not have any teaching qualifications, and I do not think that did him any harm either.</p>
</speech>
